    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16064" root="رغو" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْغَاةٌ</span></b>  <i>A skimmer;</i> i. e. <i>a thing with which</i> (or
<i>in which,</i> as in one copy of the K,) <i>froth is
taken:</i> (S, K:) or <i>a wooden thing with which one
takes off the froth of milk:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَاغٍ</span>. (JK.)

